209
00:28:28.583 --> 00:28:33.024
Junjiro Adachi e Masao Noda.

210
00:28:33.525 --> 00:28:40.232
Tsutomu Kouda, Jyoji Atsumi e Nobuo Kawanami.

211
00:28:40.537 --> 00:28:42.871
